From 877d6255e979573c2e0f0e80e1d0ec0706efd6bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julian Cooper <115541810+Juliansgith@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:32:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 15/56] Ack the local client's advances under its own index in
 CReplayClient

CReplayClient::Process acknowledges each CMDST_Advance the local client's
marshaller sends. The binary writes that ack under the local client's
index -- mManager->GetLocalClient() (vtable +0x24), then its mIndex
(+0x20), at 0x0053D9F0-0x0053D9FA -- while the recovery wrote the replay
client's own index. The local client's ack slot in the replay client
stayed at 0, so the manager never saw a beat become available (both
clients queued, nothing dispatched) and every replay stalled at beat 0.

(Start() acks the replay's own queued beats under this client's index,
as the binary does at 0x0053D528; only the Process path differed.)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit cda6c65b9b59e0eb49031e3d2f43210063cfbead)
---
 src/sdk/moho/net/CReplayClient.cpp | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/sdk/moho/net/CReplayClient.cpp b/src/sdk/moho/net/CReplayClient.cpp
index 698bf690..d977751b 100644
--- a/src/sdk/moho/net/CReplayClient.cpp
+++ b/src/sdk/moho/net/CReplayClient.cpp
@@ -154,7 +154,12 @@ void CReplayClient::Process(CMessage& msg)
     CMessage ackMessage(EClientMsg::CLIMSG_Ack);
     CMessageStream ackStream(ackMessage);
 
-    const auto localClientIndex = static_cast<std::uint8_t>(mIndex);
+    // The Advance being processed came from the local client's marshaller, so the binary acks it
+    // under the *local* client's index: mManager->GetLocalClient() (vtable +0x24), then its mIndex
+    // (+0x20), at 0x0053D9F0-0x0053D9FA. Using this client's own index left the local client's
+    // ack slot at 0, so no beat ever became available and every replay stalled at beat 0.
+    IClient* const localClient = mManager->GetLocalClient();
+    const auto localClientIndex = static_cast<std::uint8_t>(localClient != nullptr ? localClient->GetIndex() : mIndex);
     ackStream.Write(localClientIndex);
 
     std::int32_t ackBeat = beatDelta;
